&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 35.95pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -17.95pt; line-height: 115%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.15pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 115%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 17.85pt 0pt 18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company is treated as a pass-through entity for federal and state income tax purposes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The income tax allowance and related tax accounting &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;in the accompanying income statement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; limited to taxes associated with regulated operations and do not represent taxes payable by the Company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 17.85pt 0pt 18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
