&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 17.85pt 0pt 18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 1.5pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 115%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company's worldwide effective tax rate for the year &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;ended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; December 31, 2025, is 10.4%. The difference between the statutory federal income tax rate and the Company's effective tax rate is primarily due to the equity component of AFUDC:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="width: 459pt; margin-left: 14.2pt; border-collapse: collapse;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
